    "q": "What is the best image size for X in 2026?",
    "a": "X gives no pixel size for a post photo. Its help center says a single photo shows in full anywhere from 2:1 to 3:4, up to 5MB, as a JPEG, PNG or GIF. A 16:9 landscape such as 1600 by 900 sits well inside that window and is the size hubStudio's Image editor marks Best for an X post."
