    "a": "X recommends 1500 by 500 pixels for the header and 400 by 400 for the profile photo, as JPG, GIF or PNG, with no animated GIF in either slot. The profile photo caps at 2MB. X warns that 60 pixels at the top and bottom of the header could be cropped on some screens, so keep words in the middle."
