  },
  {
    "q": "How many pictures can I add to one post on X?",
    "a": "Four. X's help center allows up to four media items in a post, and the app lets you mix them, for example two photos, a GIF and a video. Through the API, the rule is stricter: four photos, or one animated GIF, or one video. Photos and GIFs don't count against the 280 characters."
